SECTION 3. PERPETUAL COMMERCIAL, CLOUD & AI TRAINING RESTRICTIONS
================================================================================

3.1 Prohibition on Commercial Hosting & Competitive Exploitation:
You SHALL NOT engage in any Commercial Hosting or Competitive Exploitation of the 
Software or any Derivative Work without first obtaining a separate, written, and 
fully executed commercial license agreement from Asteria Studio. This restriction is 
perpetual, irrevocable by passage of time, and does not convert to an open-source 
license at any future date.

3.2 Anti-Circumvention & Derivative Work Parity:
You SHALL NOT circumvent, bypass, or evade the restrictions in Section 3.1 through 
technical, structural, or legal artifice. Modifying code, adding new features, 
rewriting prompts, changing agent names, wrapping the Software behind a proxy, 
splitting execution across client-server boundaries, or offering the Software free 
of charge while monetizing adjacent compute, storage, tokens, support, or platform 
access DOES NOT exempt You from the requirement to obtain a commercial license.

3.3 Prohibition on AI Model Training, Distillation & Synthetic Data Harvesting:
You SHALL NOT use the Software, its prompts, its orchestration logic, or any outputs, 
reasoning traces, intermediate artifacts, or code generated by the Software to train, 
fine-tune, distill, align, benchmark, or evaluate any machine learning model, large 
language model (LLM), or autonomous agent system that is intended for commercial 
distribution, commercial API access, or competitive deployment against Asteria Studio.

